cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software release and the associated article when available."
title: "SPEI-Based 3-D Drought Object Tracking"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-06
repository-code: https://github.com/wanghengncwu/spei-3d-drought-object-tracking
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Heng
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Fuqiang
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Python software for identifying monthly drought patches,
  linking them across adjacent months, constructing three-dimensional
  meteorological drought objects, generating catalogues, and conducting
  one-factor-at-a-time sensitivity experiments from precomputed SPEI fields.
keywords:
  - drought
  - SPEI
  - three-dimensional drought object
  - event tracking
  - meteorological drought
license: MIT
